      "writtenOn": "2026-06-16T14:46:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack for keeping `TypedSpan`.\n\n\nWith respect to `ityp`, for things that are not using the hack to derive privately from `std` containers, I\u0027d rather not use a new namespace and instead put it inside of `dawn::`. I feel 2 out of 7 about that.",
      "parentUuid": "2659dd1b_5964ed7c",
      "revId": "50875156328a00f945c7a3d888362070445c2de9",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6714fb4a_df5f5994",
        "filename": "src/utils/span.h",
