        "id": 1000257
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-16T15:24:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From my side, `ityp` never means anything to me, it always just seems like a weird namespace thing. So, `dawn::TypedSpan` is a lot clearer compared to `ityp::Span`",
      "parentUuid": "e50874cd_9bc5b5f7",
      "revId": "50875156328a00f945c7a3d888362070445c2de9",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
