      "writtenOn": "2026-06-17T14:24:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Huh, I though it was `i`nteger `t`ype. The more you know.\n\nI think things that move into src/utils should move up into the `dawn` namespace similar to what this is doing. We could drop the `Type` if we\u0027re never going to have an equivalent untyped `dawn::Span`.\n\nPart of the reason for dropping the namespace is when we use these from tint I don\u0027t want to have to type `dawn::ityp::Span` instead of just `dawn::Span` all the time.",
      "parentUuid": "03e8892e_e8aa1d10",
